        "created_at": "2013-03-11T03:45:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>IndyCon has ended. I had a very good time. I ended up playing Sentinels five times and all other games a total of six times. :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&gt;G had provided some raffle prices and one of the people who one a set was someone I'd taught the game to Fri night who'd fallen in love with it. She was _VERY_ happy. I have a picture of her recreating the moment of her joy. Will try to remember to post a link to it when I get it off the camera.</p>",
